<title>JAPAN: Advantest shares leap on recovery hopes.</title>
<headline>Advantest shares leap on recovery hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advantest Corp shares leaped in Thursday morning trade, bolstered by hopes that earnings posted by semiconductor equipment makers would recover soon, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0155 GMT, the shares were 250 yen higher at 6,050 yen.</p>
